{%- comment -%} Art Avenue — FAQ {%- endcomment -%}
<section class="module module--faq">
  <p class="aa-eyebrow module__eyebrow">Questions</p>
  <h2 class="aa-h2">Good to know</h2>
  <div class="aa-measure">
    {%- if product.metafields.ava.faq.value -%}
      <div class="aa-body rte">{{ product.metafields.ava.faq.value }}</div>
    {%- else -%}
      <details class="aa-faq"><summary>How long does delivery take?</summary><p class="aa-body aa-muted">Lead times depend on whether a piece is in stock or made to order — shown in the buy box above.</p></details>
      <details class="aa-faq"><summary>Can I change the size or finish?</summary><p class="aa-body aa-muted">Yes. Most pieces can be customized — speak with a design consultant to specify.</p></details>
      <details class="aa-faq"><summary>Do you offer trade pricing?</summary><p class="aa-body aa-muted">We have a dedicated trade program for designers and architects. Apply via the Trade page.</p></details>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</section>
